From: Dmitry Mostovoy <stavultras@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 12:47:26 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 46/46] hw/mips: MediaTek MT7663E Wi-Fi card, radio silent

PCIe card model for the unmodified mt7615e driver (MT7663 / MT7613BE,
2x2 802.11ac, 2.4 / 5 GHz; Cudy WR1300 v2 / v3, WR1300S): chip ID, the
PCIe remap window, eFuse with a minimal EEPROM, driver / firmware own,
N9 ready, WPDMA rings with an event for every MCU command (patch
semaphore taken / released, firmware scatter unanswered).  The ROM patch
and N9 firmware load, hostapd runs; nothing goes on the air.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012GbUcwR34gg9RgGTEtNN6J
